  "problem": "The rate of growth in the number of people $P(t)$ with food poisoning in an small town follows the logistic growth model\n\n$$\n\\frac{dP}{dt}=0.15P-0.000\\,03{P}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $t$ is the time, in weeks, since the first reported cases. If there were $100$ cases initially, how many people with food poisoning there are after $4$ weeks?",
